HST Office: Page Color on Writer's Design tab.

Writer's Design tab gets the Office "Page Color" button: a colour drop-down that sets the background colour of the
page style, the same setting as the page colour of the sidebar. The colour toolbox controller learns the page
colour command, the controller is registered for Writer, and the command gets its label.

